WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.317
This query consumes the employee performance interface.

00:00:03.317 --> 00:00:07.082
The total-sales threshold remains outside the view.

00:00:07.082 --> 00:00:11.732
That is useful because different reports may choose different thresholds.

00:00:11.732 --> 00:00:18.448
The stable performance definition stays shared, while temporary business rules remain report specific.
